  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "First, convert NUMs into a set.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 2520,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 76,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "NUM underscore set equals set NUMs.",
      "start_ms": 2940,
      "end_ms": 6520,
      "start_frame": 88,
      "end_frame": 196,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "This gives us unique values and fast average membership checks.",
      "start_ms": 7000,
      "end_ms": 11520,
      "start_frame": 210,
      "end_frame": 346,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Longest starts at zero.",
      "start_ms": 12040,
      "end_ms": 13560,
      "start_frame": 361,
      "end_frame": 407,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Now go through every unique number.",
      "start_ms": 14020,
      "end_ms": 15980,
      "start_frame": 421,
      "end_frame": 479,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "And here is the most important line in the whole solution.",
      "start_ms": 16360,
      "end_ms": 20700,
      "start_frame": 491,
      "end_frame": 621,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "If NUM minus one is not in the set, only then do we start a sequence.",
      "start_ms": 21380,
      "end_ms": 26520,
      "start_frame": 641,
      "end_frame": 796,
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "Why?",
      "start_ms": 27340,
      "end_ms": 27840,
      "start_frame": 820,
      "end_frame": 835,
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Because there is no predecessor.",
      "start_ms": 27840,
      "end_ms": 29960,
      "start_frame": 835,
      "end_frame": 899,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "So this number is the beginning.",
      "start_ms": 30760,
      "end_ms": 32520,
      "start_frame": 923,
      "end_frame": 976,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Set current to NUM and length to one.",
      "start_ms": 33100,
      "end_ms": 35940,
      "start_frame": 993,
      "end_frame": 1078,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Now keep checking current plus one.",
      "start_ms": 36500,
      "end_ms": 38680,
      "start_frame": 1095,
      "end_frame": 1160,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "While the next value exists, move current forward and increase the length.",
      "start_ms": 39480,
      "end_ms": 44820,
      "start_frame": 1184,
      "end_frame": 1345,
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "When the next value is missing, the run is finished.",
      "start_ms": 45520,
      "end_ms": 49380,
      "start_frame": 1366,
      "end_frame": 1481,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Update longest and finally return longest.",
      "start_ms": 49960,
      "end_ms": 53620,
      "start_frame": 1499,
      "end_frame": 1609,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "That's it.",
      "start_ms": 54460,
      "end_ms": 55360,
      "start_frame": 1634,
      "end_frame": 1661,
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "The code is short because the main work was understanding where a sequence should start.",
      "start_ms": 55360,
      "end_ms": 62360,
      "start_frame": 1661,
      "end_frame": 1871,
      "word_count": 15
    }
